# Reason: Ren'Py 7 games. Ren'Py 7 accepted `scene x with fade:`, `show x:` and `screen x:` with a colon and no block under it, and a screen property with no value (`focus_mask`, `imagebutton auto:`). Ren'Py 8.5.3 rejects both as parse errors. The rules apply only when `renpy.lexer.renpy7_syntax` is set (Ren'Py 7 detection).

diff --git a/renpy/lexer.py b/renpy/lexer.py
